Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.98,0:00:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I carry high my craven flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,my ally I'm gonna fly and let my\Nstruggles shoot me through the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be a pity if we\Nlingered here and let our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.08,0:00:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,pretty sparks of life\Nblend aloud and disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be fog that even\Nyou can't navigate If someone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,strong like you is lost then\Nwho will set me straight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause when the waves\Ncast, my heart exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been your kindness and your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.82,0:00:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That would free me from the mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.12,0:00:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail to a new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.54,0:00:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Weigh anchor, ride as high as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.38,0:00:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure, I don't need anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I go fast as I am, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.68,0:00:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear you laughing like\Nyou're numb to it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.72,0:00:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we're dashing together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we're never gonna fall, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.16,0:00:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole world may now be my enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.70,0:01:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Water swirls, but I ain't\Nbacking down so long as I'm free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.30,0:01:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought I'll give it. Come\Nround the current with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.22,0:01:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All in, wake up bright and\Nearly, making for the peak we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.66,0:01:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All in, wake up bright and\Nearly, making for the peak we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.70,0:01:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.70,0:01:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.22,0:01:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.18,0:01:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But whatever doesn't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.70,0:01:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.76,0:01:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.86,0:01:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me your worst Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.32,0:02:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.90,0:02:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to hold me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.36,0:02:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A dragon doesn't run from a rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.82,0:02:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you a story.\NStraw Hat 20 years ago, the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.24,0:02:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,people of guano watched their\Nhero boil and their country
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.84,0:02:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,burn ever since then they\Nhave prayed for a new hero
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.60,0:02:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and now here you are I'm\Nbegging to meet the same end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.58,0:03:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Flame, Dragon Torch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.30,0:03:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna throw that punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.72,0:03:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll melt you alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.58,0:03:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you even get the chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.12,0:03:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Rattles!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.80,0:03:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Reef!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.82,0:03:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Turtle!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.74,0:03:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The heat you can't melt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.32,0:03:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The old man taught me how to throw\Na punch without even touching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.58,0:03:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe I know what\Nyou mean by Haki now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.32,0:03:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called Rio in the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.22,0:03:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're over stressing yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.04,0:04:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow the Haki to move to your fist\Nfrom the parts that don't use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.70,0:04:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never hurt my friends again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.72,0:04:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn your hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Blazing Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.36,0:04:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.20,0:04:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come, ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.98,0:04:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Play, Back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.46,0:04:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.70,0:05:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that light!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.00,0:05:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.78,0:05:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.42,0:05:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.70,0:05:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.92,0:05:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him hell, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.90,0:05:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to end this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.48,0:05:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.48,0:05:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.00,0:05:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,For Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.06,0:05:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,For Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.18,0:05:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,For Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.44,0:05:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.58,0:05:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.42,0:05:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me prove!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.42,0:05:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Onward!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.48,0:05:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,To Kuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.14,0:05:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.05,0:05:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.61,0:05:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look back! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.54,0:05:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Those fools think I don't\Nknow what they're up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.38,0:05:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They're headed to Kuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.24,0:06:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The heir to the Kozuki clan\Nis waiting at their castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.44,0:06:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Go kill the little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.52,0:06:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill his whole family while you're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.68,0:06:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wipe them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.86,0:06:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll exterminate their clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.52,0:06:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Odin has children.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.80,0:06:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Better go finish things up then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.38,0:06:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have killed Lord Odin, but\Nwe won't let you kill his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.20,0:06:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.90,0:06:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone is stupid enough to stand\Nagainst the Shogun, then shoot them dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.30,0:06:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you idiots understand now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.86,0:06:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The true death of my grudge!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.44,0:06:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now suffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.22,0:06:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.74,0:06:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll all die along with\Nyour beloved Kozuki's!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.48,0:06:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what happened to Odin's wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.16,0:07:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We confirmed her death in Bekori town.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.70,0:07:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No one else escaped the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.52,0:07:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Their accursed clan is gone at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.06,0:07:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, time, y'all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.48,0:07:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for all of you to make a choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.42,0:07:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you stand beside me\Nin service of this land?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.56,0:07:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Or will you go to war?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.36,0:07:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You know damn well what we'll say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.42,0:07:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never be shogun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.66,0:07:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We are loyal to the Kozuki clan alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.76,0:07:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We will avenge Odin's death.\NNo matter what it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.62,0:07:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The land of water will not fall today!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.52,0:07:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Show no fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.94,0:07:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Onward
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.00,0:08:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that strange light?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.76,0:08:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Last breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.74,0:08:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea you were so weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.14,0:08:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You called yourself Samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.16,0:08:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe Samurai weren't\Nworth a damn to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.62,0:08:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that you looked down on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.98,0:08:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the fool now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.44,0:08:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on the throne and you're burning\Nto death in a battle you can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.46,0:08:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Face it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.72,0:08:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The weak can't protect a damn thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.80,0:08:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, as for the rest of the\Ncountry, I have an announcement!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.14,0:08:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a new Wano, painted in\Nthe calendar of the Kurozumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.18,0:08:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.14,0:09:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.36,0:09:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.60,0:09:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All able-bodied men, I've\Ngot a new job for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.44,0:09:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.60,0:09:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back my dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.44,0:09:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take him away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.26,0:09:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.50,0:09:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No, please don't shoot! Please let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.26,0:09:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.52,0:09:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.08,0:09:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You will all work to produce weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.56,0:09:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Put your back into it, slackers!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.48,0:09:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna work until you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.98,0:09:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.98,0:09:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't grow crops in this soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.76,0:09:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Some thirst.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.02,0:10:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.38,0:10:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.46,0:10:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.68,0:10:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This land is a living hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.22,0:10:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.42,0:10:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.90,0:10:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Help us, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to live,\Nyou better keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.78,0:10:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Those goods are more important\Nthan your worthless lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.34,0:10:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop them in your death!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.36,0:10:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This country is closed off from the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.72,0:10:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Scream as loud as you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.06,0:10:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No one will come to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.20,0:10:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.00,0:10:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die than do this another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.00,0:10:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.66,0:11:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We must survive the coming winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.00,0:11:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A long cold night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.74,0:11:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not lose faith in Lady Toki's words.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.40,0:11:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.22,0:11:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,that's funny. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.94,0:11:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I know those filthy\Nswine will eat anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.00,0:11:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Even and I'll reject smile fruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.78,0:11:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.56,0:11:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Then laugh till you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.56,0:11:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be just like Ebisu Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.70,0:11:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when you're starving\Nand mourning your loved ones,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.44,0:11:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll keep laughing like fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.62,0:11:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but maggots, so I'm sure\Nyou'll keep eating the trash I dump on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.24,0:11:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you glad I gave you\Nall the gift of laughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.54,0:11:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now no one has to listen to you cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.80,0:12:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Starts the banquet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.52,0:12:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat your film!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.28,0:12:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Every pleasure is yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.36,0:12:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd be dead or dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.26,0:12:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd be all alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.12,0:12:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You know Komurasaki, I had\Neverything, exactly as I wanted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.46,0:12:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me you\Nworked at the pleasure
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.58,0:12:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,hall all that time just\Nto get revenge on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.20,0:12:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a slut.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.02,0:12:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll die, but I'm taking\Nyou with me, Komurasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.66,0:12:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the price of your betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.46,0:12:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You can serve me a drink in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.16,0:13:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Foxfire Kin'emon and the Akazaya Samuil.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.96,0:13:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If they want to challenge\Nus, then I welcome it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.46,0:13:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send them right back to\Ntheir graves with a single stroke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.64,0:13:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is pandemonium.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.76,0:14:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.54,0:14:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I never could!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.88,0:14:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.62,0:14:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried my best, but I'm useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.38,0:14:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to help, but I'm not strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.72,0:14:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.02,0:14:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.84,0:14:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The land of Wano will soon need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.86,0:14:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to rebuild the Kozuki clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.22,0:14:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.06,0:14:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.66,0:14:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain that you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.56,0:14:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The people of Wano will see your courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.88,0:15:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll surely move their hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.52,0:15:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyori! Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.94,0:15:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.24,0:15:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I must show my courage, or I will\Nbring shame to the Kozuki clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.94,0:15:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.44,0:15:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot let everyone's faith go to waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.84,0:15:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not give up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.58,0:15:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.18,0:15:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.82,0:15:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinamon! Kiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.94,0:15:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're alive, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.50,0:15:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We're making it through this together!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.60,0:15:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.02,0:15:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.40,0:15:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawhat, keep fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.96,0:15:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't stop till Kaido is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.66,0:15:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to free us from Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.84,0:16:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Free us, Mr. Stride.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.88,0:16:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,For 20 years, this cruel\Nbattle has continued.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.94,0:16:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, we cannot finish it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.58,0:16:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless Kaido is vanquished for good,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.40,0:16:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,it will never end!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.44,0:16:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You fought well today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.68,0:16:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought you\Ncould push me this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.98,0:16:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.58,0:16:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, you're still not strong\Nenough to change this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.62,0:17:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I took it all with my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.76,0:17:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I rose to be an emperor of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.18,0:17:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's another win for Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.48,0:17:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all right. Stop above now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.56,0:17:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No one in this rotten world can defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.96,0:17:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.96,0:17:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know anything, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.84,0:17:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Our country's trapped in\Nan endless cycle of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.68,0:17:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to keep stealing from other\Nnations to pay heavenly tributes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.72,0:17:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,or we'll lose our rights as\Na kingdom, as human beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.34,0:17:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just slaves of the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.32,0:17:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You bow to the celestial dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.16,0:17:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not fight back?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.16,0:18:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been drafted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.36,0:18:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to become a marine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.14,0:18:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I want to be\Na government lapdog?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.54,0:18:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just say that you're a bit\Nmore than This kingdom can handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.98,0:18:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your damn mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.08,0:18:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't make me do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.72,0:18:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go. You You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.92,0:18:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't, I'll rip you to...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.60,0:18:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over Kaido as we agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.68,0:18:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Your country will be given full rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.66,0:18:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You can even join the reverie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.90,0:18:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.14,0:18:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not your bargaining tool!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.16,0:19:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.00,0:19:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaino's on the loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.74,0:19:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard's using us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.18,0:19:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll get caught again\Nas soon as he's hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.62,0:19:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a prison ship, not a restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.70,0:19:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.72,0:19:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.90,0:19:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it says here the guy's only 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.60,0:19:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A bounty like this is\Nway too high for a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.72,0:19:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.06,0:19:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.20,0:19:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to be a pirate,\Nthis is your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.62,0:19:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Rox wants to have a talk with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.46,0:19:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems you've got a choice to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.74,0:19:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido, join the Rox Privates!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.72,0:19:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They're invincible. Now stay\Nthe hell out of their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.98,0:20:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido something big just happened\Ncome on we're headed to god valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.40,0:20:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The rocks pirates are done for but how\Nwhat kind of joke is that they had the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.42,0:20:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,strongest pirates in\Nthe world on their crew
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.50,0:20:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,i heard a marine named garp took them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.12,0:20:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, I bet they just had a falling out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.50,0:20:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They were all power and no teamwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.00,0:20:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell are you, Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.60,0:20:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That little bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.46,0:20:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.28,0:20:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyo, kyo, kyo, kyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.22,0:20:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been ten years since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.62,0:20:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you've become a one-man army, Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.70,0:20:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyo, kyo, kyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.78,0:20:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Throughout all of history,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,mankind has turned to violence\Nto solve every problem they face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.42,0:20:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,As well they should, I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.20,0:20:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're animals, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.48,0:20:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The strong have always conquered the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.88,0:20:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, but what's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.80,0:21:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The other remnants of the rocks\Npirates will grow in power, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.80,0:21:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Weapons will decide the\Nfuture And I have plenty to spare
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.56,0:21:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,the self-appointed rulers of\Nthis world preach peace and they
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.20,0:21:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,claim that power is their birthright.\NWill drag them from their thrones.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.62,0:21:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and on to the battlefield
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.44,0:21:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,a person's
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.78,0:21:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,worth should be determined by
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.06,0:21:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,strength that is the only way to\Nensure true justice and Freedom!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.22,0:21:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but nothing's going to stop me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.02,0:22:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard Yamato talking about Joy Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.80,0:22:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,As for where he learned that\Nname, I couldn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.12,0:22:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know Odin was waiting until he\Nappeared to open up the borders of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.82,0:22:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're waiting for him\Nyourself, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.64,0:22:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.62,0:22:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I know\Nexactly who Joy Boy is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.72,0:22:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot afford to be distracted again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.64,0:22:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I must trust that Lupi will triumph!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.00,0:22:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.86,0:22:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Save the land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.72,0:22:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Set its people free!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.96,0:22:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Make those clowns!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.98,0:23:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.80,0:23:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come forth, Flame Clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.08,0:23:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave my call!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.20,0:23:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell is that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.12,0:23:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No fire can withstand this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.62,0:23:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The waters of soul shall deliver you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.22,0:24:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.64,0:24:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like they're raining\Ndown from the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.80,0:24:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Black Nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.82,0:24:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die! Stay with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.96,0:24:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.28,0:24:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You've had to endure so much pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.50,0:24:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,For years and years,\Nyou've remained strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.88,0:24:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost lost you there!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.22,0:24:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't get washed away!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.54,0:24:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.44,0:24:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd this water come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.90,0:24:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Whoa! Whoa! I did it! Possumey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.90,0:25:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is happening to the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.38,0:25:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The flame clouds, they're fading!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.54,0:25:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.12,0:25:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our time's up! It's falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.80,0:25:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come forth, flame clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.66,0:25:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.56,0:25:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That should be enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.54,0:25:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.66,0:25:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.50,0:25:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.56,0:25:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.54,0:26:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crush every nation under\Nmy heel, just like Wado!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.16,0:26:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know why you fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.24,0:26:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of world would you create?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.12,0:26:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.16,0:26:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.92,0:26:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.22,0:26:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a world where my friends can smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.62,0:26:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Where they can eat until they're full!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.62,0:26:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.38,0:27:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,FIDAL!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.44,0:27:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.02,0:28:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I know who Joy Boy is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.06,0:28:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you curious, King?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.54,0:28:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.04,0:28:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the man who's going\Nto defeat me someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.34,0:28:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then maybe he doesn't exist.
